      <span class="cr-index">02 / SHARE</span>
      <h2>Declare rules for a single repo, or an entire organization.</h2>
      <p>Each repo keeps its rules in <code>.code-rules</code>. Publish shared defaults from an organization <code>.code-rules</code> repository and import them. Mix org rules and project rules as needed.</p>
      <a href="/concepts/libraries/">See how rule libraries work →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="cr-panel cr-library-tree">
